  "guideP1T": "What a potency is",
  "guideP1": "A homeopathic medicine is made by diluting a starting substance step by step and shaking it at each step. The number tells you how many steps: 6C means six steps of 1 part in 100; 6X means six steps of 1 part in 10. Q (mother tincture) is the undiluted starting tincture.",
